OL,3,GNEWSASevere drought declared in parts
OL,4,Aof southern England
OL,5,
OL,6,FA severe drought has been declared
OL,7,Facross parts of southern England after
OL,8,Fmonths of low rainfall.
OL,10,FParts of Cornwall, Devon, Dorset,
OL,11,FSomerset, East Sussex and West Sussex
OL,12,Fare affected.
OL,14,FThe announcement by the Environment
OL,15,FAgency follows a meeting of the
OL,16,FNational Drought Group, which reviewed
OL,17,Fwater resources and drought conditions
OL,18,Facross England.
OL,20,FSupplies have been significantly
OL,21,Fimpacted by high demand following the
OL,22,Fhottest summer on record.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
